window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What happens when the love of your life turns out to be your teammate?</p> <p>Ranked as the number one wide receiver, Devlin Frank is part of the dynamic duo expected to win the Rangers a championship trophy this season. He's also one of the only openly bisexual players in the league, a fact he never denies, but also doesn't advertise—especially since the only person he’s interested in is his new teammate, Rex Williams.</p> <p>Rex is new to professional football. Dropping out of college his sophomore year to take care of his mother with terminal cancer, he missed the draft and spent the last three years looking for his shot which he found with the Rangers Special Teams. Kickoff returner and 3rd string running back, he’s not going to jeopardize his fledgling career by advertising his growing feelings for his teammate, who is the organization's superstar.</p> <p>What starts off as friendship with hidden desires quickly turns into stolen moments with hot and heavy nights, but when their teammates find out about their relationship, will they be penalized for who they love?</p> <p></p>"; 
